# Per-package statement-coverage floors for `make cover`.
#
# Floors sit just below the measured value so they catch a real regression
# without failing on a one-line refactor. Raise a floor when a package
# improves; lower one only with a comment explaining why.
ALL                82
cmd/iec104-shield  70
# config sits near 75%; the TLS success path is exercised in the proxy
# package with certificate fixtures, so keep this floor one point lower.
internal/config    74
internal/iec104    72
internal/observ    88
internal/policy    92
internal/proxy     86
scripts/covercheck skip
